@startuml
title State diagram of the system operations for "Process Sale"

[*] --> WaitingForNewSale

state "Waiting for new sale" as WaitingForNewSale
state "Recording items" as RecordingItems
state "Waiting for payment" as WaitingForPayment
state "Completed sale" as CompletedSale

WaitingForNewSale --> RecordingItems : enter item
RecordingItems --> RecordingItems : enter item
RecordingItems --> WaitingForPayment : end of sale
WaitingForPayment --> WaitingForNewSale : complete payment
WaitingForPayment --> CompletedSale : payment approved
CompletedSale --> [*] : finish and wait for next customer

@enduml
